{'symbol': 'MCD', 'date': '2022-09-13 12:00:00', 'title': "EDF RENEWABLES NORTH AMERICA SIGNS AGREEMENT WITH MCDONALD'S CORPORATION FOR APOLLO SOLAR PROJECT", 'text': "SAN DIEGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EDF RENEWABLES NORTH AMERICA TODAY ANNOUNCED A 15-YEAR VIRTUAL POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENT (VPPA) WITH MCDONALD'S CORP (NYSE: MCD). THE 255 MWAC / 332 MWDC APOLLO SOLAR PROJECT WILL HELP MCDONALD'S TO MEET ITS SUSTAINABILITY GOALS AND ADVANCE ITS COMMITMENT TO CLIMATE ACTION. APOLLO SOLAR, LOCATED IN TEXAS, IS EXPECTED TO BEGIN DELIVERY OF LOW CARBON ELECTRICITY IN JUNE 2024. APPROXIMATELY 300 JOBS ARE EXPECTED TO BE CREATED DURING THE 2023-2024 CONSTRUCTION PHASE WITH"}